This repository contains a reverse-engineered specification of the Jissbon
"Master Remote Vibrator" Bluetooth Low Energy protocol, derived from clean-
room analysis of an iOS sysdiagnose Bluetooth HCI capture. The author —
**Nyra** (@lyrawuuu on GitHub) — is the sole reverse engineer of the protocol documented herein.

